    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. it's just that it's getting kinda weird though... the black spots are actually starting to look like a dark curtain or shadow coming down from the corner of my eye. it's making me a little nervous. is it possible this is just a migraine aura or something like that? i really don't want to deal with an ER visit if i can help it, can u just tell me if this sounds like something i can just sleep off or if i definitely need to go in?",
